The JSON Schema files in this directory are derived from the
openAPIV3Schema of the CRDs of
https://github.com/k8snetworkplumbingwg/multus-cni at the version named in
sources.yaml. Modification: every node with properties gets
additionalProperties: false, except preserve-unknown-fields nodes, maps
and allOf/anyOf/oneOf/not branches. The files under crds/ are the upstream
CRDs, as compact JSON where named .json.
